+* Manual / backfill: pass ``params={"day": "YYYY-MM-DD"}`` to reprocess any
+  specific day.  The normal interval logic applies when no param is supplied.
+* Rerun (clear): the DELETE + INSERT in a single transaction makes every run
+  idempotent — rerunning the same date is always safe.
+
+Backfill
+--------
+With ``catchup=True`` and ``start_date=2026-09-01T00:00 UTC`` the scheduler
+creates one run per UTC day from 2026-09-01 onward.  ``max_active_runs=1``
+serialises the runs so only one writer holds the DuckDB file at a time.
+
+Reprocess a past day without a backfill
+----------------------------------------
+    airflow dags trigger pageviews_daily --conf '{"day": "2026-09-15"}'
+
+Or use the Params UI.
